{"id":"word:hebrew:H8393","type":"word","title":"תְּבוּאָה","subtitle":"H8393 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"income , i.e. produce (literally or figuratively)","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to תְּבוּאָה (H8393) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-f.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 43 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"תְּבוּאָה (tᵉbûwʼâh) means income , i.e. produce (literally or figuratively) First listed occurrence: 2Chr 31 5."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"תְּבוּאָה","transliteration":"tᵉbûwʼâh","pronunciation":"teb-oo-aw'","strong":"H8393","lemmaId":"hebrew:H8393","partOfSpeech":"n-f","forms":["תְּבוּאַ֣ת","תְּבוּאָתָֽ/הּ","תְּבוּאֹ֣ת","תְּבוּאַ֖ת","תְּ֝בוּא֗וֹת"],"morphs":[["HNcfsc/Sp3fs",8],["HNcfsc",6],["HNcfsc/Sp2ms",4],["HNcfpa",4],["HR/Ncfsc",3],["HNcfsc/Sp3ms",3],["HNcfpc",2],["HNcfsa",2],["HTd/Ncfsa",2],["HC/R/Ncfsc",2]]},"definitions":{"short":"income , i.e. produce (literally or figuratively)","usage":"fruit, gain, increase, revenue.","full":"H8393. tebuah תְּבוּאָה noun feminine proventus , product, revenue — ׳תּ absolute Psa 107:37 3 t.; construct תְּבוּאַת Lev 23:39 11 t.; suffix תְּבוּאָתִי Job 31:12 ; Prov 8:19 ; תְּבוּאָתְּךָ Deut 14:28 2 t.; תְּבוּאָתֶ֑ךָ Prov 3:9 ; תְּכוּאָתוֺ Lev 19:25 + Ezek 48:18 Qr (Kt תבואתה ), תְּבוּאָתֹה Jer 2:3 ; תְּבוּאָתָהּ Exod 23:10 7 t. + Ezek 48:18 Kt (so Co); תְּבוּאָתֵנוּ Lev 25:20 ; plural תְּבוּאֹת 25:15 4 t.; תְּכוּאוֺת Prov 14:4 ; 16:8 ; תְּבוּאֹתֵיכֶם Jer 12:13 ; &#8212; 1 product, yield , usually of earth (= crops, etc.) ׳תּ הָאָרֶץ Exod 23:10 ; Lev 19:25 ; 23:29 ; 25:3 , 7 (used as food for man & beast, compare 25:22 ) Josh 5:12 , compare Neh 9:37 ; Lev 25:15-16 , also Ezek 48:18 ; in Gen 47:24 ׳בַּתּ must = of the crops ( בּ partitive, compare בְּ I. 2. b ; ᵐ5 strike out בְּ ); שָׂדֶה׳ת 2Kin 8:6 ; 2Chr 31:5 ; ׳תּ כֶּרֶם Deut 22:9 compare Psa 107:37 ; חָאֲדָמָה תּ ׳לָחֶם Isa 30:23 ; ׳תּ גֹּרֶן & ׳תּ יָ֑קֶב Num 18:30 ; ׳תּ זֶרַע Deut 14:22 ; ׳תּ דָּגָן 2Chron 32:38; as property of husbandmen, or people Lev 25:20 ; Deut 14:28 ; Deuteronomy 16:25; 26:12 ; Prov 3:9 ; crops as determined by season, ׳תּ שָׁ֑מֶשׁ Deut 33:14 (|| יְרָחִים גֶרֶשׁ ); yield of a year שָׁנָה Lev 25:12 , 22 ; compare 25:21 תּ ׳עָשָׂה , subject שָׁנָה . 2. a. income, revenue , in General Job 31:12 (almost = possessions) Prov 10:16 ; 14:4 ; 15:6 ; 16:8 ; Eccl 5:9 compare Isa 23:3 (revenue of Tyre from trade with Egypt in bread stuffs). b. figurative gain of wisdom ׳תּ חָכְמָה Prov 3:14 ; 8:19 ; product of lips ( ׳תּ שְׂפָתָיו ) 18:20 , i.e. results of his speech (|| פִיאִֿישׁ מְּרִי ); of Israel as Yahweh's product Jer 2:3 ; of Israel's wickedness 12:13 .","rootNote":"from 935 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"2Chr 31 5","keyReferences":["2Chr 31 5","2Chr 32 28","2Kgs 8 6","Deut 14 22","Deut 14 28","Deut 16 15","Deut 22 9","Deut 26 12"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":43,"occurrences":[{"reference":"2Chr 31 5","book":"2Chr","chapter":31,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"תְּבוּאַ֣ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc"},{"reference":"2Chr 32 28","book":"2Chr","chapter":32,"verse":28,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לִ/תְבוּאַ֥ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfsc"},{"reference":"2Kgs 8 6","book":"2Kgs","chapter":8,"verse":6,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"תְּבוּאֹ֣ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfpc"},{"reference":"Deut 14 22","book":"Deut","chapter":14,"verse":22,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"תְּבוּאַ֣ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc"},{"reference":"Deut 14 28","book":"Deut","chapter":14,"verse":28,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"תְּבוּאָ֣תְ/ךָ֔","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp2ms"},{"reference":"Deut 16 15","book":"Deut","chapter":16,"verse":15,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"תְּבוּאָֽתְ/ךָ֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp2ms"},{"reference":"De